### 登录到租户管理员，可以使用角色和用户相关api
POST http://localhost:3003/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "tenantAdmin",
    "password": "root"
}

### 创建一个新的用户，将上方登录返回的token复制到下方的请求头后面。
POST http://localhost:3003/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6InRlbmFudEFkbWluIiwiaWQiOiI2NzA0ZTkyYjExOTg4YzUzOTdjYTc1M2UiLCJpYXQiOjE3MjkyMzEyNzIsImV4cCI6MTcyOTIzNDg3Mn0.1cwbeiXo_NBaQGduPT64KhJ3Iw3B-vct76FnBtuIl7o

{
    "username": "testUser",
    "name": "test",
    "password": "tteesstt"
}

